The dataset is derived in part from:
  - the ICS Advisory Project (https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project),
    licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0 — attribution and
    share-alike on the database itself apply; see
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  - the CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog and CISA Vulnrichment
    (U.S. Government works, public domain)
  - FIRST.org EPSS scores (freely redistributable under FIRST.org's EPSS
    data terms)
  - MITRE ATT&CK for ICS content (released for public use under the ATT&CK
    Terms of Use, https://attack.mitre.org/resources/terms-of-use/ —
    attribution required)

Any redistribution of the released dataset must retain attribution to the
ICS Advisory Project and note the above upstream sources; re-read each
source's current terms before redistributing.
